        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2043"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts436" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts439">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If you send your CVs–</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2044"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts440" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts450">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know ¬Nurzhan right, who graduated from the construction [faculty] at the Polytechnic,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2049"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts452" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts470">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He found a new job immediately, some private objects in Balkhash. They told him there to fake a signature.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2058"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts472" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts474">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He refused.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2059"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts476" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts480">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because if tomorrow there is something wrong, he will answer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2061"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts482" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts484">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So he left [this job] there, scared.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2062"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts486" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts496">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then he sent his CV to some place here, and he got a job somewhere. Was it a private place or not - that I don’t know. He already bought a house, he says he has a lot of money.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2067"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts498" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts500">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He got drawn in there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2068"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts502" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts510">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But he can’t talk to people, if he starts talking, his face keeps twitching, he's a stutterer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2072"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts512" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts522">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But for such projects there, his head works.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2077"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts524" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts528">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Once he quit his previous job, he immediately found a new one and already bought a house.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2079"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts530" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts532">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>To one another.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2080"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts540" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts556">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He has it from birth, his father was an alcoholic or something, because of this he stutters.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2087"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts555" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts560">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And sometimes, when he talks to people, his face cramps.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2089"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts562" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts572">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But he does the scientific projects and so on with no problems.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2094"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts574" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts584">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh, recently where he went, he said, he went abroad recently, due to his work.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2099"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts586" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts592">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Now there are a lot of jobs for such people.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2102"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts594" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts598">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Send your CVs everywhere.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2104"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts600" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts612">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>From one place to another, if you don't like it, to a third. And there is that guy... he changed his job to some cool one, ¬Yedil. Apparently a new place was opened, he says.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
